{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "defd694c-c003-81f4-8127-d09d6c4b161a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T14:42:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Edson Duarte",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. This is Edson Duarte. I'm calling for my mother, her water bill. Can you hear me okay? I'm walking, the signal is not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, a little choppy. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. So my mother got a shutoff warning in the mail. Shutoff warning, yes. And the bill is [inaudible] very high. Way more than normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, the last part cut out. The bill is very high?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:39:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, very high. I'm walking a long way right now, the shuttle is delayed, so if I drop, I call back. Okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Can I get the name on the account and the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The name is Linh Duarte. D-U-A-R-T-E. Linh, L-I-N-H. I don't have the address with me, sorry. Only the account paper, I have it at home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can find it by name. [pause] Okay, I have the account. I see a past-due balance and a notice dated last week. What's your concern with the charge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:27-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so last month the toilet was running constantly. Constantly. We fixed it already, the part, a new flapper, done. But that is why the usage is up, I think. It is not real use. It is a leak, one toilet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So the usage spiked from the running toilet, and it's been repaired."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, repaired. So I don't think she should pay this much. And the shutoff, how much time do we have? Before they turn it off. That is my main question."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The notice should list a date. I'm looking at it now. It gives you until the end of next week to pay or to contact us about the balance."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "End of next week. Let me say it back, end of next week. Okay. That is not a lot of time. [line breaks up] ...so I want somebody to review the charge. Can I have a supervisor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I can put a note on the account that a review has been requested so the shutoff is flagged. The supervisor isn't at the desk right now. I can have them call you back. Is this the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, you can use 401-555-0168. That is me, my cell. Zero-one-six-eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:39-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0168. I'll note the toilet leak and that it's been repaired. If you have a plumber's receipt for the part or any record, hang onto it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the receipt from the hardware store. Okay, good. So supervisor calls me, the note is on the account, and the date is end of next week. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:41:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:42:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you, thank you very much, Priya. I think I lose you now, I go under the bridge. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T14:42:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
